.TH MOXY-STATUS 1 "" "moxy"
.SH NAME
moxy-status \- Show all configured servers and moxins with their sources
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B moxy status
.SH DESCRIPTION
Loads the moxyfile hierarchy and discovers moxins from MOXIN_PATH, shows each config level with its servers and moxins, validates TOML syntax, server commands, and moxin configs. Exit code 1 on validation failure.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR moxy (1)
